From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] power: qcom-battmgr: default-off phone supply GET diagnostics

Reference d9383c7 supplies USB through properties64/24 after permissions17/18.
Probe readability first without adding supply setters or automatic requests.
Preserve the old17/18 decoder, lease, watchdog and hardware helpers unchanged.
Source: OnePlusOSS d50b305f and linux-sm8750-erhai d9383c7. GPL-2.0-only.

